### 平台服务首批联调（2026-05-27）
@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@platform = http://localhost:8090
@contentType = application/json
@token = 替换为登录返回 token

### 0. 启动前提示
# 1. Docker 的 jeez-gateway 容器会占用 8080，联调前先执行：docker stop jeez-gateway
# 2. 本地启动命令：
#    $env:SPRING_DATASOURCE_USERNAME='root'
#    $env:SPRING_DATASOURCE_PASSWORD='123456'
#    mvn -pl zp-service-platform spring-boot:run
#    mvn -pl zp-gateway spring-boot:run

### 1. 登录
POST {{gateway}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "mobile": "13800000001",
  "password": "demo-login"
}

### 2. 查询当前用户（将 {{token}} 替换为登录返回 token）
GET {{gateway}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. 查询门店列表
POST {{gateway}}/camps/get
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}

### 4. 查询门店详情
POST {{gateway}}/camp/get
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "campId": "10001"
}

### 5. 查询渠道列表
POST {{gateway}}/channels/get
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "campId": "10001"
}

### 6. 直连平台服务查询版本资源（验证可信头）
POST {{platform}}/edition/resource/get
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
X-Auth-Verified: true
X-User-Id: 12001

{
  "campId": "10001"
}

### 7. 参考期望
# /auth/me -> userId=12001, roleCode=admin
# /camps/get -> campId=10001, poiId=11001
# /camp/get -> name=路客云演示租户
# /channels/get -> accountId 包含 25301、25302

### 8. 查询角色列表
POST {{gateway}}/role/camp/get
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "campId": "10001",
  "keyword": "",
  "pageNum": 1,
  "pageSize": 10
}

### 9. 查询角色权限详情
POST {{gateway}}/roleAuthority/camp/get
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "campId": "10001",
  "roleId": "13001"
}
